    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if i don't want to fight it anymore? fighting just feels like trying to hold onto smoke. it feels more natural to just let the rest of the rooms go dark. there's a kind of peace in thinking about it... like, if the house is empty anyway, why keep the lights on just to see how much is missing?",
