      "content": "i think you're missing my point. it's not about finding \"rest\" in some future version of life. it's that the empty house is better when it's just dark and quiet. there's no point in staying and watching everything vanish piece by piece. it would be so much cleaner if i could just... reach over and flip the main switch, you know? just stop the process before there's nothing left of me to even feel the loss.",
